  "description": "Why We Love It\nThe Envie Advanced is the go-to bike whether you’re jumping into a road race, racing a triathlon or training for an Ironman. The bike is an extension of the body, so take the aero advantage and efficient pedaling platform, enjoy the ride and achieve the results you’ve only dreamed of in the past. The women’s-specific geometry balances you over the bike, for flawless handling that is as easy to control on descents as it is on a sprint to the finish line. Envie Advanced harnesses every ounce of power for training or racing.\n\nGiant Contact SLR Aero handlebar\n\nGiant SpeedControl brakes\n\nRideSense compatible\n\nHigh-performance Giant wheelset\n\nHybrid OverDrive steerer and Advanced-grade composite fork\n\nA lightweight Advanced Composite frame is hand-crafted in-house to provide optimally tuned stiffness and compliance for female riders.\n\nPowerCore bottom bracket for unrivaled pedaling stiffness and stability\n\nAeroSystem tube shaping and vector composite seatpost for the ideal aerodynamic performance\n\nDesigned using Liv’s 3F Design Philosophy to build bikes for women\n\nLivRight Sizing Philosophy for the perfect fit across all sizes",
